	(text "Reads the absolute angle of the 6 x 2.5 mm diametric magnet in the crown hub (sensor centred on the\naxis to 0.3 mm). Powered only while the crown moves (SENS_VDD switched on the main board)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 164 27 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4b45ff0a-2f3a-494c-849a-98e8d90073e4"))
	(text "MODE (14) and Z (8) tied to VDD = I2C mode\n(MagnTek Figure 18). Both have internal\n200 k pull-ups; the ties make it certain.\n\nOUT, PUSH, U/V/W: other output modes,\nunused -> left open.\n\nSDA/SCL pull-ups (4.7 k) are on the\nmain board, fed from SENS_VDD." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 280 60 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f0e6ac4b-e7de-4f5c-99c8-734ea6edf538"))
	(text "C1 at pin 13. D1 = MagnTek's optional VDD TVS, footprint only.\nEEPROM setup (zero angle, direction) needs VDD > 4.5 V: done once on a fixture through J1." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 164 126 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ad3fe5b8-6675-4451-a415-41e160f7ca6a"))
