	(text "Each DRV5032DU has two outputs: OUT1 switches on a north pole, OUT2 on a south pole (3.9 mT,\n20 Hz sampling, 1.6 uA). Two of them, 90 degrees apart around the magnet, give four edges\nper turn with direction -> the first twist wakes the nRF within <= 77 degrees (report 4.11)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 19 157 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "64019814-74d6-44bd-9aad-cab54e437494"))
	(text "Push-pull outputs: no pull-ups.\nThermal pad (5) to GND for\nmechanical strength.\nC2/C3: TI's >= 0.1 uF at VCC." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120 190 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "09099497-16ab-471e-b203-60ca7ccda85f"))
